[{"answer":"Oh, there you are, good.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-3-2023-08-11-20-38-49/1.mp3"},{"answer":"Sorry, I'm a bit late - there was a long queue.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-3-2023-08-11-20-38-49/2.mp3"},{"answer":"So, have you worked out how to deal with this assignment then?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-3-2023-08-11-20-38-49/3.mp3"},{"answer":"Not yet, we've only been here a couple of minutes ourselves.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-3-2023-08-11-20-38-49/4.mp3"},{"answer":"Can you just remind me what the task is exactly?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-3-2023-08-11-20-38-49/5.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, there are two, no, three, parts to it:","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-3-2023-08-11-20-38-49/6.mp3"},{"answer":"first, we've got to write an essay about ways of collecting data.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-3-2023-08-11-20-38-49/7.mp3"},{"answer":"What's the title of the essay exactly?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-3-2023-08-11-20-38-49/8.mp3"},{"answer":"I've got it here:","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-3-2023-08-11-20-38-49/9.mp3"},{"answer":"'Assess the two main methods of collecting data in social science research'.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-3-2023-08-11-20-38-49/10.mp3"},{"answer":"And how much do we need to write?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-3-2023-08-11-20-38-49/11.mp3"},{"answer":"1500 words.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-3-2023-08-11-20-38-49/12.mp3"},{"answer":"That's for the essay.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-3-2023-08-11-20-38-49/13.mp3"},{"answer":"Then, for the second part of the assignment, we have to choose one method of data collection,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-3-2023-08-11-20-38-49/14.mp3"},{"answer":"and 'carry out a small-scale study',","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-3-2023-08-11-20-38-49/15.mp3"},{"answer":"'making appropriate use of the method chosen to gather data from at least five subjects'.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-3-2023-08-11-20-38-49/16.mp3"},{"answer":"And then we have to write a report on the study?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-3-2023-08-11-20-38-49/17.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right, of three to four thousand words.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-3-2023-08-11-20-38-49/18.mp3"},{"answer":"Did you get as far as discussing which form of data collection we should go for -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-3-2023-08-11-20-38-49/19.mp3"},{"answer":"questionnaire or interview, isn't it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-3-2023-08-11-20-38-49/20.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, I think we should use a questionnaire.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-3-2023-08-11-20-38-49/21.mp3"},{"answer":"It'll be so much less time-consuming than organising interviews, I reckon.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-3-2023-08-11-20-38-49/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Once we've agreed on the wording of it, we only have to send it out and wait for the responses.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-3-2023-08-11-20-38-49/23.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes, I think it probably would be quicker.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-3-2023-08-11-20-38-49/24.mp3"},{"answer":"But what did that article he gave us last week say about the quality of data from questionnaires?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-3-2023-08-11-20-38-49/25.mp3"},{"answer":"I'm pretty sure it recommended questionnaires as a source of 'highly reliable data'.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-3-2023-08-11-20-38-49/26.mp3"},{"answer":"As long as you design the questionnaire properly in the first place, the data will be fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-3-2023-08-11-20-38-49/27.mp3"},{"answer":"No, I'm sure it talked about drawbacks as well, didn't it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-3-2023-08-11-20-38-49/28.mp3"},{"answer":"Something about the response rate and the problems you get if it's too low.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-3-2023-08-11-20-38-49/29.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah, but we only need data from five subjects anyway.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-3-2023-08-11-20-38-49/30.mp3"},{"answer":"I suppose so.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-3-2023-08-11-20-38-49/31.mp3"},{"answer":"Another drawback I remember it mentioned was that","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-3-2023-08-11-20-38-49/32.mp3"},{"answer":"questionnaire data tends not to reveal anything unexpected, because...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-3-2023-08-11-20-38-49/33.mp3"},{"answer":"it is limited to the questions fixed in advance by the researcher.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-3-2023-08-11-20-38-49/34.mp3"},{"answer":"Come on, Rosa. This is only a practice.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-3-2023-08-11-20-38-49/35.mp3"},{"answer":"It's not meant to be real research, is it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-3-2023-08-11-20-38-49/36.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, not sure about that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-3-2023-08-11-20-38-49/37.mp3"},{"answer":"Maybe I'd better go through the article again, just to be sure.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-3-2023-08-11-20-38-49/38.mp3"},{"answer":"Can you remember what it was called?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-3-2023-08-11-20-38-49/39.mp3"},{"answer":"Sample Surveys in Social Science Research', I think.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-3-2023-08-11-20-38-49/40.mp3"},{"answer":"By Mehta.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-3-2023-08-11-20-38-49/41.mp3"},{"answer":"MEHTA?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-3-2023-08-11-20-38-49/42.mp3"},{"answer":"Yeah.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-3-2023-08-11-20-38-49/43.mp3"},{"answer":"And he also recommended a more recent book, called...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-3-2023-08-11-20-38-49/44.mp3"},{"answer":"'Survey Research', by Bell, I think.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-3-2023-08-11-20-38-49/45.mp3"},{"answer":"It's in that series published by London University.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-3-2023-08-11-20-38-49/46.mp3"},{"answer":"And if we tried to use interviews instead,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-3-2023-08-11-20-38-49/47.mp3"},{"answer":"I saw a book in the departmental library that'll be helpful: it's called 'Interviews That Work',","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-3-2023-08-11-20-38-49/48.mp3"},{"answer":"by Wilson, published in Oxford in 1988.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-3-2023-08-11-20-38-49/49.mp3"},{"answer":"Right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-3-2023-08-11-20-38-49/50.mp3"},{"answer":"Oh, I've got a tutorial now.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-3-2023-08-11-20-38-49/51.mp3"},{"answer":"Can we meet up again later this week?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-3-2023-08-11-20-38-49/52.mp3"},{"answer":"What about Friday morning?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-3-2023-08-11-20-38-49/53.mp3"},{"answer":"Suits me. 11 o'clock?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-3-2023-08-11-20-38-49/54.mp3"},{"answer":"Fine.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-3-2023-08-11-20-38-49/55.mp3"},{"answer":"Before Friday, I think we should all look through the reading list.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-4-test-2-part-3-2023-08-11-20-38-49/56.mp3"}]
